From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Prithwiraj Samanta <prskid1000@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 06:53:05 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] telecode: theme axes - compose modes across variable
 collections

Every variable collection is one theme axis (Mode: Light/Dark x Brand: A/B).
An alias into another collection now resolves in that collection's mode for
the node (scene-graph resolveVariableForNode, used by colour and number
resolution), so one variable can follow two axes. telecode_theme_get /
_set / _active read and pin a frame's mode per axis (explicit vs inherited,
one undo step) and set the document-wide mode.
